    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like they ever even knew me. they only knew the version of me that succeeded. if i'm not that anymore, i'm nothing to them. it feels like it would be easier to just not be around than to watch them realize they were wrong about me. do you think they'd actually be better off if i wasn't there to let them down?",
